<title>USA: Premark International Inc Q1 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Premark International Inc Q1 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.32		    $0.19</p>
<p> Oper net		  20,800		   11,800</p>
<p> Revs		     545,600		  528,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  65,600		   63,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q1 results are from continuing operations and exclude income of $32.8 million or $0.52 a share from discontinued operations. Net including all operations was $44.6 million, or $0.71 a share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
